  "text": " Global \n Distributor\n Europe\n\n \nProducts\nSolution\nConstruction Sites\nService & Support\nNews\nAbout Shantui\n\nFunction Navigation\nFind Dealer\n\nProduct Center\n\nContact Us\n\nRelated Links\nAfrica\nMiddle East Region\nSoutheast Asia\nEurasia\nAmerica\nDistributor\nInquiry\nContact Us\nEXCAVATOR\nShantui presently boasts nearly 30 years of production history since the manufacturing of first excavator in 1994. At present, Shantui excavator product lineup covers >30 product models in 1.2t~200t and meets the demands of >95% customers. Relying on the resource advantages of Shandong Heavy Industry Group, Shantui is the domestic sole excavator brand with proprietary power system, hydraulic system, and chassis.\nSearch | Contact Us | Privacy\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n© 2025 Shantui Construction Machinery co.,Ltd All Right Reserved\nJEREI Digital | Producing and Maintaining",
